{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4f4c912d-4e7d-4418-84c1-e038659e5e35",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "title: Qiskit implementation\n",
    "description: Using Qiskit to implement ideas from the single-systems lesson.\n",
